  "description": {
   "en": "Needing a new place, the Shirotani family is introduced to an apartment through a friend. Their joy is short-lived, though, as they learn about a strange rule this apartment building has: “Whenever you're in front of the owner, you must always wear a smile.”. If they break this rule…\n\nEscape is impossible! The curtains open on a apartment building survival horror.\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [MagaPoke](https://pocket.shonenmagazine.com/episode/14079602755278176246)",
   "ja": "友人の紹介でとあるマンションに引っ越してきた城谷一家。喜びも束の間、このマンションに存在する奇妙なルールを知ることとなる。それは「オーナーの前では必ず笑顔でいること」。もしそのルールを破ってしまうと‥‥。脱出不可能！マンション・サバイバル・ホラー、開幕。"
  },
